{
  "id": "OutboundRtN8n20261010",
  "name": "Outbound Follow-Up - Retell + n8n (inactive until configured)",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/New_York",
    "errorWorkflow": ""
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "setup-and-cost-notes",
      "name": "Setup and Cost Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 430,
        "content": "## Configure before activation\nCredentials: Jobber OAuth2 or Housecall Pro API, Supabase, Twilio, Retell API, and Slack in the separate error workflow. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_* value. Run schema.sql. Select exactly one FSM provider in Read FSM Records. Keep inactive until consent, quiet hours, caller ID, opt-out, and test numbers are verified.\n\n## Voice vendor quote (2026-10-10)\nAssumption: US low-volume pilot, approximately 1,000 seasonal voice minutes/month, no enterprise commitment or add-ons. Retell selected as the lowest clearly verifiable all-in PAYG configuration: $0.0866/min using $0.055 infrastructure + $0.015 platform voice + $0.0016 GPT-5 nano + $0.015 Retell telephony, plus $0.005 per batch dial. Bland starts at $0.14/min before carrier; Vapi charges hosting plus model, voice, transcriber, and telephony. Re-quote all vendors before renewing the client retainer. Voice and telephony are client-billed."
      },
      "position": [
        -500,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "estimate-every-6-hours",
      "name": "Estimate - Every 6 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "position": [
        -320,
        -120
      ],
      "notes": "estimate_followup"
    },
    {
      "id": "reengagement-daily-08-00",
      "name": "Reengagement - Daily 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "position": [
        -320,
        20
      ],
